[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24307.75, "timestamp": "06:45:07", "text": "不，我把它們吹走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24315.59, "timestamp": "06:45:15", "text": "。  我把他們打飛了。回到這裡。回到這裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24320.548, "timestamp": "06:45:20", "text": "[音樂] 我好像無法改變。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24323.75, "timestamp": "06:45:23", "text": "[音樂] 感覺怎麼樣？  [音樂] [掌聲] [音樂] [音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24336.948, "timestamp": "06:45:36", "text": "[音樂] 好了，我回來了。我回來了。  我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24346.548, "timestamp": "06:45:46", "text": "剛才走的時候忘了靜音。我接到電話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24350.948, "timestamp": "06:45:50", "text": "不"}]